{"version":1,"content":"<p>這個專欄內容一向主打泰國種種，今次破例想說說中國的橫琴。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;話說橫琴有單位邀請我參與露營節活動，讓小弟相隔20多年重踏內地。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;活動中我分享了泰國旅遊露營的資訊，相對演講的內容，更讓我花心神的，是要重新適</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:22:13.463684+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T09:00:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:18:19.892188+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:18:19.892188+00:00","content_hash":"66a398e6729b1820608e4600d8f05d2cad9065c6488631693a6756fdb559e907","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}